TensorFold recipes for Qwen3.5-MoE on GB10
Copyright 2026 <your name>

This repository documents and scripts how to serve qwen3_5_moe checkpoints
(Qwen3.6-35B-A3B, Sage-A1.5) with image input and MTP drafting on a single
NVIDIA GB10, using the TensorFold Python engine (0.6.x line).

